auditcore_invoicesynth 0.1.1 — attribution and authorization

New implementation in auditcore (docs/architecture/DONUT_OCR_PLAN.md,
sections 2b and 2d). No code was copied from other repositories; the Donut
token convention (<s_field>value</s_field>, <sep/>) is reimplemented, no
clovaai/donut code is included. Invoice base data comes from the dependency
auditcore_invoicegenerator 0.2.1 (MIT), which is used unchanged.

On 2026-09-22 the rights holder decided: "die Bibliotheken sollen MIT sein,
die anderen Repos nicht; die Bibliotheken kommen nach auditcore".
Status: USER_AUTHORIZED_MIT for this library.

Fonts are NOT distributed with this package. Rendering uses system fonts
from the free-license catalogue (DejaVu: Bitstream Vera license; Liberation
and Noto: SIL Open Font License 1.1) or downloads verified by SHA-256; each
used font file is recorded with its hash in the dataset manifest.

Generated datasets are entirely synthetic. IBAN, BIC and VAT IDs have valid
check digits but use a fictional bank code list; every rendered page is
visibly marked "SYNTHETISCH" (decision E5, 2026-09-24).
